<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Pheexiroosixxa Erga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ergemallo Phexirosixxa Langaxxa Erga</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Pheexiroosixxa Erga</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Phex.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ergemallo Pheexiroosixxa Langaxxa Erga</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ergemallo Pheexiroosixxi langaxxi erga borreessendeek gargar gargar hedheeke booncho'ni hexxeexxe olmixxe kiristoosito'aten. Tenne ergak umi yaadi dhariyye barachchiisalluwwixxa fuggoxxa hujenna insa'nexxa barachcho uuddaaxxenni dadendeexxa shookishshaaxxa hedho xaa'naten. Tenne kexxeexxe rakkuwwa'a hiissichchoke kadaak Yessuusii'i ifixxe illenni uudeekiirinna isi barachchiisaa wodda ifixxe manshanni laqeek manni sa'iseexxe barachcho darree'n Mageniixxeenna Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosixxee dhugaatixxa ege'na afaten. Kunni borreessanji giddii'ninni xexxe'achcho asseek «Kiristoosi higeexxi dagabaan» hitaaxxe dhariinxe barachchoxxeete; tenneenni uuddaaxxenni haaso'aa wodda «Kiristoosi hige dagateenaa'n turaachchi Mageni manji duuchchi ifixxe cubbonaa'ni higaashshate malee'e mitti manjinna ba'aaxxa hasa gophammaxxeeten» hiyyaan.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">E'yichchoo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoositotixxa ye'ensha <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dhariyye barachchiisalluwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosixxa langaxxa hige daga <char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nage'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Yessuusi Kiristoosike ergemallo Simi'ooni Pheexiroosi'a.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Mageno no'oke'ninna anjirallo no'oke Yessuusi Kiristoosixxe qullumma darree'n no'o adhdhinnennexxe bifanni ulfatteexxa amana adhdheekeerii'a.<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Magenokanna Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosii'i ege'nati badhaadhikinna nage'i ha'no'a bira sa'owwaal.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aamagnetixxa Ye'enshanna Filensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Ifike ulfinninna ifixxe ellenni no'oo ye'eeka isoo ege'nati hedhoteenna Mageno fakkaatatee no'aa hasisaachcho duuchcha isixxi Magenummatixxi hunna no'oo'a uute'een. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Fuggoxxe gaabbenaa'n kexxeexxa butta duuchcha'ni hexxeexxe buttatixxe hujexxe busha hedhonaa'n gattineexxi ookkonee Magenummatika adaba qoodendinaashsha tenne yaanuwwa darree'ni hara lummexxeexxanna ulfaateexxa addachchiisa no'a uwwe'een. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Tennexxee wo'ma jabeenninni amana ha'nooxe'ni elle laphphatee jabaatte; ellete'ni ege'na, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ege'nate'ni ifi hira, ifi hirate'n, ti'ni hiyya, ti'ni hiyyate'ni Mageno fakkaata; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />Mageno magenoofatatte'n dayyummatixxa eeyya, dayyummatixxe eeyya'ni jaalala lebbe. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Kunni adabuwwi ha'no'a bira sa'eechcho kaddeele Gootta no'oka Yessuusi Kiristoosii'i ege'nati woyi fuldinabaakenna gummabeloke kadatenaa'n ha'noo gattissaan. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Konne adabuwwa afebaak kinni bayya hedheechcho afabaake, yookaan balla'aken; edixxe ifixxe cubbonaa'n luqqi hiyyeexxanna dedhe'een.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Tennexxee anke dayyuwwaa! Ye'injo ha'nokanna fileensha ha'noxxa kokeessatee edi caala jabaatte; tinni kaddaachchinna tenne yaaneera assitineele haranga guggufatinabaan.<verse eid="2PE 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyyichchi Maxaafika Raaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Konne qicinni Gootta no'okenna anjirallo no'oke Yessuusi Kiristoosixxe duuchchi woddixxe moottumma'ni e'ya ha'noo'a wo'ma qicinni uwwendaan.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyyichchiwwi Maxaafika Raaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Tennexxee ani fedhee qiconna tenne yaanuwwa egendineexxe kaddo'oolenna midde abixitineexxe dhugaa'n ti'ni hitine hexxino'oole tenne yaanuwwaxxee ha'noo heddole kassi assatenaa'n gaga'mi hiyyabe'non. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Konne buttike duunkaani giddo hedhenne qico'n ha'noo dammassa hassissaaxxe labbe ane'ni leellitaan. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Tinni kaddaachchinna Gootti no'oki Yessuusi Kiristoosi ane'ni ifiseeshshanni konne buttatika duunkaana hirbange'ni waale me'aannexxa ege'neennen. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Ani ta'a si'aaneechchinna reyoti ha'noonaa'n gargar higennechchi uduma ha'no tennee yaanuwwa duuchchi wodda qalli hitinaashshaten.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosike Ulfinnixxeenna Raaginke Hiyyichchixxee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Gootta no'oke Yessuusi Kiristoosixxe hunnanninna isixxe langaxxe dagaxxee ha'no'ni kulennexxe qixxe'ni isika ulfinna ille no'oxxen uundeette malee manjiinke beekkuminni dadendeexxa manjiinxa xingo hordonfeetebaan. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Tenneexxi buuttonna, «Isike gaachchanniki ulfinni ani eeyyaank anki belti konneten» hiyyaak hafuuri isi'a dagee wodda Mageno Annakenaa'ni gaachchannakanna ulfinna adhdhe'een. <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />No'onna isinni welti woyyitte kooba'ni he'nenna wodda kunni hafuuri iimi'ni dagaa wodda lanqeennaxxeeten.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Yoona raagiink hiyyichchi lumo qico no'aa kokeesemmeen; hashshaa sooddaa qico'ninna soodi mariink bakkalchi qalbe ha'nooxxe'ni ifaa qico'ni; dukkanate'ni ifammake ifi'a xexxe'achcho assendammashsha ha'nonna konne hiyyichchi'a xexxe'atineele eloxxe assitinaan. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Duuchchiinxi edi darre ege'naa hassissaaxxi, konne woyyichchi maxaafi giddo hedheeka raagiinka hiyyichcho duuchcha huuni manjinna ifike yaadike ora'ni tikaakebaan. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Tennexxi buutonna raagi Magenokenaa'n ergemeek manni Woyyichchi Hafuurinni akeekemmeexxi haaso'eexxe malee'e haranga manjiinxe fedhiinni dageekebaa.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Dhariyye Wabeekonna Barachchiisaluwwiinxa Ba'ne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Yaane kinni dhariyye wabeeko ardi giddo hexxeemmashshnni iittanni ha'no giddonna dhariyye barachchiisaluwwi ke'aan Insa'nenna insa'nee wodeeka Gootta waakanteexxi ba'ne iyyedagaaka dhariinka barachchisaluwwa luuxe iyyaashsha assinaan. Tennenninna insa'ne umo ifike'ni keekantebaaxxa ba'ne iidaqqinaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Heddi manni insa'neexa diqachchiissaaxxa huje hordofaan; insa'nexxe buuto'a dhugaatik ori yowwemaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Kunni dharichchi barachchiissaluwwi haafemma'ni ifi'aa dadeemmaxxe jirtenni ha'no booji'aan; murte insa'nexxinna olmii'ninni qixxesendeexxen; ba'netinna insa'nee dhugaandinni heqqitaan.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Mageni cubbo hujjeemmaxxa erganna mararebaang gehaanemeti giddo huneexxi dukkanatixxe bale giddo murtetee uggeechchinni, <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />qullummatike lallaballo kade'eemmak Nohi'i wele torbaane manninni welti anjireexxi edixxa butta duuchcha mararebaang cubbaaleeyyete'n balleessamma wode'e iyyedageechchinni, <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />iittanni cubbo hujaake duuchchi'a fakkeenna kadaashsha Soodomikanna Gomoraka qachchuwwa bululoke kaddaa qico'ni gubeexxi mureechchinni, <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />qullichchake kadeemmakanna xaqartiyyetixxe battitte hujenni wixixxi hiyya'n hedhemmaka Looxii'i anjireechchinni, <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />iikki qullichchi manjichchi insa'ne giddo hedheemma wodda uudaammaxxeenna laqaammaxxe yaane'n lubbo isixxi barra barra'ni xaqartiiyeetixxe hujenni wixixxi hiteexxenna kaddoole, <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Gootta dhugaati isoo magenoonfata'n hedhaakaara hega uushshotenaa'n hittaa insa'ne anjira'eexxanna xaqartiyyete'n mura'ni eettene murtetixxe barra'a hitta asse heqqee insa'ne geesisaaxxa ege'ne'een. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Giddii'ninni eettene battitte gaabbenni ifixxa maaliinxa halcha hordofakaaranna ookkone baallooma tuffataakaara murtetee heqqeexxi insa'ne geessisaan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Kunni dharrichchi barachchiisaluwwa iittanna mitte riffi afeekerranna ifi dukaake kadeemmaxxe'e iimatixxa daduwwa yowwinaa woddanna sodantabaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Yaane kinni erganna insa'ne irra jabaxxenna hunnaammeeyye kaddeenni hexxeexxi Gootti edo insa'ne'ni yowwichchiinka haaso'a fulchexxabaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Kunni dharichchi barachchiisaluwwi kinni mitteechchonna ege'nebaaxxe yaane'ni e'ya'ni yowwaan; insa'nenna abidenshateenna shiyematee ilemeeshsha yaada ifike callinni akeekemaammakenna qalbeefachcho afebaake biniichchishshaten. Insa'nenna ba'aake biniichchishshaten. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Ifixxe xaqaro'a hasisaaka xaqarotika hira adhinaan; manguba arishsho'ni fenxe hinaa wodda gammashotishsha laakko'winaan; ita ha'watixxe jila'ni he'neexxi ci'memmeekenna battone'eke kandeexxi ha'nonni welti jaalalatixxe jila'ni offolaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Ille insa'neexxe'n yabaabulle wo'miteemmaxxee cubbo hujatenaa'n gantabaan; amanate'ni ti'ni hiyebaaka mannanna dedhinsaan; insa'nenna haafendaaxxe qalbe anfe'een, insa'nenna badinemeeken. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Qajeela ora waaleexxi xaqarotika runda eeyyemmake ookkone Bi'oorika belto Bele'aamika ora hordonfeexxi dedhake'ni inbe'een. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Isi kinni qaxxamura ifixxee xixxemeeni; haaso'a dande'abaak harichchi manjiinke laagadinni haaso'e ookkone wabeekixxa maraattumma uurrisse.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Kunni dharichchi barachchiisaluwwi eettenee baggeexxe muumuwwanna hobonbalteti oofemeemmake duumanchuwwan; insa'nee heqqexxaxxinna dimma dukkanan. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Insa'nenna woyi fulabaaka hollatika hiyyichchoora haaso'ati dedhake'ni ibemmake manni giddii'n baaje dagemmaka manna qiliphphisaaxxe maaliinxe gaabbenni maxxinseexxi dedhinsaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Insa'ne umo ifinge'ninni ba'netike garba kandeenni he'neexxi, «Wele manna leexxa fuldinaan» hina'ni addachchiisa uunaan; manji eettenee hiremeexxe yaane'a garbaken. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Gootta no'okanna anjirallo no'oka Yessuusi Kiristoosii'i ege'nati butta duuchchaxxe battummanaa'n baanjeechchi uduma haaroba abidemeexxi injifatemoole edixxi irra insa'nexxi udumixxi hedho insa'ne'a haranga yoxxaaxxe kaddaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Qullummatika ora egeneechchi uduma insa'ne'a uwwememmak woyyichcha ajajanaa'n udumi'a higati mannii'ni edonni ookkonee qullummati ora ege'naa gonpheele woyyamman. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />«Wonshi honqo'emmaxxa honqo'o ito'a higaan» iittanni «Booyye anshexxoolenna higgeexxi dhoqqete'ni gangallattaan» hiyyemeemmak mammaassi insa'nexxee dhugaatike mammaassan.<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Addachchiisa Uwwendeeka Goottiinka Dago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Anke jaaluwwaa! Tinni ta'a ha'no'aa borreessaannexxi anxe langaxxe ergan; lamiinxa anxa erga ha'no'aa borreessenlchi qajeelto ha'noxxa qalbe dammassonnaaten. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Iittanni edo woyyitte wabeeko haaso'emeemmaka hiyyichcho iittanni ha'nooxxe ergameeyye darree'ni Gootta no'okenna anjirallo no'okika ajaja qalli hitinaashshaten.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Duuchchiinxe yaanne'aa edisineexxi udumike barro'n ifi fixxa fuggoxxa gaabbe hordofaati gacifatakiir gacifata'ni dagaaxxa tenne ege'ne. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Insa'nenna, «Daganno hiyye addachchiisa uwweemmak hedhee? Edik annuwwi reyemmaxxe dadatike ke'itonaa'n techchi qico'ni duuchchiinxi yaane hexxemmashanni hexxaan» hinaan. <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Yaane kinni kunni manni iimuwwa olimina'ni Mageniinke hiyyichchinni dadendeexxi hexxammashanni, buttaa wodi'iinxe oddo'ninna wodi'ik hujendeemmaxxa egena'ninni waakantaan. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Eettenne yanna hexxeemmaxxi butta duuchcha wode'ik liqiinde baxxe. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Ookkone hiyyichchinninni ta'aa hexxeexxi iimuwwanna butta cubbaaleeyye baxxaaxxe murtetixxe barra qici'aa giiratee heqqende turtaan. <verse eid="2PE 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ha'no kinni anke jaaluwwaa Goottake'ni mitte barra kuma woggashsha, kuma wogganna mitte barrashshate kaddeexxa tenne mitte yaane deetinoqqe'e. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Mitti mitti manna'ni tureechcho fakkaatolenna Gootti ifike addachchisatike hiyyichcho muuxo'a turabaan; yaane kinni isi ayyinna ba'abaashsha, duuchchiingi aadde aago'a ha'noxxee ossaan. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Goottiinxi barra kinni moodhalchiinsha daggaan; eettene barra iimuwwa lumooke luuljinni saxxaan; iimuwwatixxi daduwwanna lumoke giirake eebbinjinni baxxaan; buttatinna ise'ni hedheechchi duuchchi gubataan. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Yoona duuchchiinxi yaane iitta baxxa'neechchinni ha'no hitta hexxinaake manna kada hasissutaa? Ee, woyyummatinna Mageno fakkaatati hedha ha'noo hasissaan. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Iittanni ha'noo Mageniinxa barra heqqexxina'ni dago isika muddansa hasissaan; eettene barra iimuwwa giirati itendeexxi baxxaan; iimuwwatixxi daduwwanna jabake eebbinjinni baqqaan. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />No'o kinni qullumma hexxaaba haaroxxa iimanna haaroxxa butta isike addachchisatik hiyyichchishshanni heqqedhate'ni he'nennen. <verse eid="2PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Tennexxee anke jaaluwwaa tenne yaanuwwa duuchcha heqqixxina'neechchinni mitte battumma belonna mitte ci'ma beloke kaddinee'naa nage'ik ha'noo afaashsha si'ikki hedhdhe. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />No'oke Goottixxi ossa ha'nooxxe anjirensha'aate kaddeexxa hedde; iittanni dayyi no'ok Phawuloosi isi'a uwwemeek beekkumixxe qixxe'n ha'no'aa borreeseen. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Isi tennee yaanuwwaxxa ifixxe erguwwa duuchcha'ni borreessedheen; isixxe erguwwa giddo sholla qicinni qalbeefatatee dandeessisabaaxxi yaanuwwa hexxeen; ege'na xe'yiteekinna ti'ni hiyyabaak manni wele woyyichcha maxaafuwwa micciirammashsha tennee yaanuwwanna ifixxe ba'ne'a micciirraan. <verse eid="2PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Yoona jaaluwwaa tenne edisineenn egendinemaxxee ti'ni hitineexxi uurritineexxe boosonaa'n xaqqaratiyyetike dedhinni sobendineexxi ibbinabaashsha xexxe'atte. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Yaane kinni Gootta no'okenna anjirallo no'oke Yessuus Kiristoosike badhaadhinninna ege'na'nni nophphe. Isi'aa ta'anna duuchchi woddi'aanna ulfinni kadowwaal. Ameeni.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>